 the commit does not stop the remote from fetching every branch."},{"number":8803,"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-pull-request-github/issues/8803","title":"Сбой проверки подписи расширения: GitHub Pull Requests","closedAt":"2026-10-29T11:52:06Z","actor":"alexr00","evidence":"gate: the cited canonical #8719 is closed — a duplicate close would strand the report (re-review, not close)"},{"number":6711,"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-pull-request-github/issues/6711","title":"Closed PRs get associated with new branches of the same name","closedAt":"2026-10-29T11:50:03Z","actor":"alexr00","evidence":"gate: open PR #9137 references the issue — someone may be fixing it; closing as duplicate is not safe"},{"number":3201,"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-pull-request-github/issues/3201","title":"Provide feedback when interacting with PR files","closedAt":"2026-10-29T11:41:11Z","actor":"alexr00","evidence":"The commit swaps the viewed button for a tree checkbox that updates before the network call finishes. It adds no loading or progress indicator for slow operations, and other PR-file interactions get no feedback."},{"number":6253,"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-pull-request-github/issues/6253","title":"Show notification badge \"Waiting For My Review\"","closedAt":"2026-10-29T11:39:20Z","actor":"alexr00","evidence":"A asks for an activity-bar notification badge, like the git changes count, showing PRs awaiting my review. B asks for item counts on every panel and sub-panel. Per-list totals need not add an attention badge on the activity bar."},{"number":8887,"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-pull-request-github/issues/8887","title":"Add support for reviewing Stack PRs","closedAt":"2026-10-02T18:39:09Z","actor":"alexr00","evidence":"Cross-repo venue mismatch: B asks vscode core for a Source Control stack tree with cascading rebase/Copilot awareness, while A's ask — stack navigation inside the extension's 'Changes in Pull Reques